WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:14.520
¿Dónde estuvo anoche, señorita?

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:19.800
I was with my boss.

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:27.080
At his place.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:30.320
Your father was found

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.680
unconscious in his bedroom

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:32.640
this morning.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:34.840
His wife, your stepmother,

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:35.520
found him.

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:38.120
We found an abnormally

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:39.560
high dose of sleeping pills

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:40.520
in his blood.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.600
He’s in critical condition.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:45.560
So tell me,

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:46.680
where have you been

00:00:46.680 --> 00:00:48.240
for the last eight hours?

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:51.560
Are you serious?

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.040
I am a suspect.
